      "name": "損益表",
      "legal_reference": "Regulamento Administrativo n.º 25/2005, article 2(4): the accounting statements are the balance sheet and the income statement (demonstração de resultados). The line structure follows the model income statement of the Professional Accountants Committee's 'Guia para a Aplicação das Normas Sucintas de Relato Financeiro' (Aviso n.º 2/2024/CPC): revenue, cost of sales, gross profit, other operating income, personnel expenses, depreciation and amortisation, other operating expenses, operating profit, finance costs, investment income, other income, profit before tax, income tax, profit for the period. Foreign-exchange gains are read as other income and foreign-exchange losses as finance costs, the usual reading of the model's lines for a business with no separate exchange line; a Macao accountant should confirm it. The numbering is this pack's own.",
